OL,3,GNEWSA'Showing my nan my medals is my
OL,4,Afavourite thing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritain's most decorated World
OL,7,FGymnastics Championships athlete said
OL,8,Fshowing his nan his medals is "one of
OL,9,Fmy favourite things".
OL,11,FJake Jarman, 24, from Peterborough,
OL,12,Fclaimed silver in both the vault and
OL,13,Fthe men's floor during last month's
OL,14,Fchampionships in Rotterdam.
OL,16,FThis made him the first British male
OL,17,Fgymnast to win two individual medals at
OL,18,Fthe same World Gymnastics
OL,19,FChampionships.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
